ome back  and rock out  inside this venue all the items in decor  match the tv shows and movies expertly  including more storm trooper helms than  you can imagine they're either buried in  the sand or on pikes to warn off  potential threats  i was going to count them all i can't be  bothered let's just say there's 69 of  them  inside we have a nod to the projections  used in star wars  where the band would usually be playing  but guess who it is  instead do you recognize this guy think  back to december 2019  this is the skin given to jeff keely who  presented the star wars event  back at risky reels all those months ago  do you remember that  by the way that event in 2019 is  actually canon to the star wars timeline  which is the strangest thing to fathom  right now  so have you tried the new mando mode the  lobbies are actually smaller as we use  pucks to track down targets and by  reducing the player count you'll find  more ai controlled enemies here who will  drop  all kinds of loot including all the  exotic weapons  the problem i find playing this mode is  that mando wrecks me  in an instant every time happy days this  update saw a removal of a minor poi  the ghost shadow building next to  mando's new poi  this spot was integral to the story it  was where we found the gnominator too  back in the day remember that and now  it's gone  how many ghosts and shadow locations  still exist on the map these days  has that storyline been forgotten  forever if so  rest in peace midas  here's a very peculiar update which is  not in the game yet  except for on the map look at it look  closely enough and you'll notice that  the map has changed colour and detail  only minor but look at the lake area  near the docks  on the new image this area is now  emptying  the water is becoming a mud but when you  visit their in-game it's just the same  as it's always been  is this foreshadowing of what will  happen next or is this just an update to  the map  well later this week a new ri